{"title":"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0a0a8f6ad73968daf554fac5839d1f7adbe1b28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19^{19} + 99^{99}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d10ef39c16dc59257704c0fa79eba147a2947fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=1552\">https://youtu.be/7an5wU9Q5hk?t=1552</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Finding a pattern for each half of the sum, even powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> have a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and odd powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> have a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/5022f18a2610d2dc59a8cd055ea5eae17345e8ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19^{19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> have the exact same property, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/5/b8530c03f0f20321a40fbf0baf661486682e78de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99^{99}$\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> also has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/e/29e0a7dd842377240046d537f17ab0137270ce07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+9=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> which has a units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using modular arithmetic:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75ef9dad0de69599575109d040e7639b9fc39fa3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[99 \\equiv 9 \\equiv -1 \\pmod{10}\\]\" width=\"188\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Similarly,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15c3fc39f1bc9a64c1f573eb133b3078538c5951.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[19 \\equiv 9 \\equiv -1 \\pmod{10}\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/9/ec91d9d5444d75ac00161eb77f2d743d167f99d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(-1)^{19} + (-1)^{99} = -1 + -1 \\equiv \\boxed{(\\textbf{D}) \\ 8} \\pmod{10}\\]\" width=\"385\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>-ryjs\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Experimentation gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/1/9c129f4219d96b4b10cbcca3beeae338ca91108b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{any number ending with }9^{\\text{something even}} = \\text{has units digit }1\\]\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/734c9872ac0a9506801bb56c341c75ee06743bc7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{any number ending with }9^{\\text{something odd}} = \\text{has units digit }9\\]\" width=\"420\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Using this we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/8/4a8c39504c5a4b8990eefee52a93c968bf42a6b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[19^{19} + 99^{99}\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/8/868a2cc7eb6f1a7e280d6578b8f519761df7dfb7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9^{19} + 9^{99}\\]\" width=\"66\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a313bf06349648df7be807bee95b651604ce7a7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> are odd, so we are left with\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59c1c010c314809684f48e73b1bb48502d78b0e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9+9=18,\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"16\" /> which has units digit <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/a/39a2ba84b5de2ac4114286e5d2493888652c6568.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\textbf{D}) \\ 8}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"58\" height=\"29\" />\n-ryjs\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/b/9ab7167334b0ed1034de1060ecd6fa1d4f50d197.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19^{19}+99^{99}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />36972963764972677265718790562880544059566876428174110243025997242355257045527752342141065001012823272794097888\n9548326540119429996769494359451621570193644014418071060667659303363419435659472789623878 which ends in 8.&#160;:) If you are really stupid and have time (like about 3 hours), this is a real brainless bash.\n</p><p>--hefei417\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 8\">2000 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2000\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a h